	(lib_symbols)
	(text "All digital I/O is 3V3. Use outside this voltage can cause damage.\n\nSee bill of materials for detailed parts information.\n\nTrace impedance on SPI/I2C, MCLK, and I2S is designed for approx 89ohm.\n26AWG ribbon cable used with Ground-Signal-Ground is approx 89ohm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
